{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 40, "text": "؟ﻦﻬﻌﻣ ﻞﻣﺎﻌﺗ ﺪﻳﺮﺗﺃ ,ﺕﺎﻴﻧﺍﻭﺪﻋ ﻦﻬﻧﺇ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 42, "text": "!؟ﻥﺫﺇ ,ﻲﺗﺍﺭﺎﻴﺧ ﻲﻫ ﺎﻣ"}
