{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 100, "text": "؟ﺙﺪﺣﻷﺍ ﺭﺍﺪﺻﻹﺍ ﻲﻓ ﻚﻠﺑﺎﻗﺃ ﻢﻟﺃ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 101, "text": ".ﻲﻟﺎﻴﺧ ﺩﺮﺠﻣ ﺍﺬﻫ ﺎﻤﺑﺭ ﻭﺃ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 103, "text": ".ﺎًﻣﺎﻤﺗ ﻦﻜﻤﻣ ﺍﺬﻫ ،ﺎًﻨﺴﺣ"}
