{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 107, "text": ".ﻢﻌﻧ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 108, "text": "ﻪﺘﻠﺻﻭ ﻥﺎﻜﻣ ﻝﻭﺃ ﻚﻟﺫ"}
