{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 134, "text": ".ﻚﻟ ﻮﻠﺤﻳ ﺎﻣ ﻞﻌﻓﺍ ،ﺎًﻨﺴﺣ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Mita wants to tell you [Yes]."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 137, "text": ".ﻲﻠﻀﻔﺗ ،ﺪﻴﻛﺄﺘﻟﺎﺑ"}
