{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 139, "text": ".ﻞﻠﻤﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺎًﻤﺋﺍﺩ ﻡﺎﻧﺃ ﺖﻨﻛ ﺚﻴﺣ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
